{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"d2d0580e06c55b9e400ab219f7145534e6a1f88cc8ea7d8b90ad9f9171320d26","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约柜迁出基列·耶琳"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大卫与千夫长、百夫长，就是一切首领商议。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大卫对以色列全会众说：「你们若以为美，见这事是出于耶和华—我们的 神，我们就差遣人走遍以色列地，见我们未来的弟兄，又见住在有郊野之城的祭司利未人，使他们都到这里来聚集。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们要把 神的约柜运到我们这里来；因为在扫罗年间，我们没有在约柜前求问 神。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["全会众都说可以如此行；这事在众民眼中都看为好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，大卫将以色列人从埃及的西曷河直到哈马口都招聚了来，要从基列·耶琳将 神的约柜运来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["大卫率领以色列众人上到巴拉，就是属犹大的基列·耶琳，要从那里将约柜运来。这约柜就是坐在二基路伯上耶和华 神留名的约柜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他们将 神的约柜从亚比拿达的家里抬出来，放在新车上。乌撒和亚希约赶车。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["大卫和以色列众人在 神前用琴、瑟、锣、鼓、号作乐，极力跳舞歌唱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到了基顿",{"noteId":11},"的禾场；因为牛失前蹄",{"noteId":12},"，乌撒就伸手扶住约柜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华向他发怒，因他伸手扶住约柜击杀他，他就死在 神面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大卫因耶和华击杀",{"noteId":13},"乌撒，心里愁烦，就称那地方为毗列斯·乌撒，直到今日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那日，大卫惧怕 神，说：「 神的约柜怎可运到我这里来？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["于是大卫不将约柜运进大卫的城，却运到迦特人俄别·以东的家中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["神的约柜在俄别·以东家中三个月，耶和华赐福给俄别·以东的家和他一切所有的。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"-","text":"在撒母耳下六章六节是拿艮","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"-","text":"或译：惊跳","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"-","text":"原文是闯杀","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}